    "description": "### Impact\r\nMariaDB server, with  `wsrep_notify_cmd` enabled would execute shell commands embedded in the name of the joiner node.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nFixed in 10.6.27, 10.11.18, 11.4.12, 11.8.8, 12.3.2.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nAnyone who cannot upgrade now should disable `wsrep_notify_cmd`.\r\n\r\n### References\r\nhttps://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-39721\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n[letchu_pkt](https://hackerone.com/letchu_pkt)",
